# DESK05 run C -- open the dialog and leave it with OK having changed nothing.
# The desktop underneath must come back byte-identical (form_dial(FMD_FINISH)),
# and the menu strings must be unchanged (install_shortcuts is idempotent).
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1500 mark A_IDLE
1800 move 196 8
2200 move 200 139
2400 down
2403 up
2600 move 600 240
3200 mark B_DIALOG
3500 move 256 369
3700 down
3703 up
3900 move 600 240
4700 mark C_AFTER_OK
5000 move 88 8
5700 mark D_FILEMENU
